    {
      "text": "While Duke Long is in the greatest danger he has been in, Purple Mountain True Monarch’s methods finally work and break through his defenses. Purple Mountain True Monarch flies to him and spits purple gas. The mystical breath lands on Duke Long and dissolves all of his defenses. Duke Long then opens his eyes, wakes, and withstands the follow-up strike.",
